WEBVTT

01:42.640 --> 01:43.520
Easy, Ye-Ye.

01:54.960 --> 01:56.560
God... It's huge.

01:56.600 --> 01:57.160
Coming through!

01:57.600 --> 01:59.080
Everyone's wrapped up like mummies.

01:59.080 --> 02:00.120
This is gonna be impossible.

02:00.920 --> 02:01.640
I did some digging.

02:02.040 --> 02:03.280
This is the Shis'

02:03.280 --> 02:03.840
fishery.

02:10.240 --> 02:11.440
You positive he's here?

02:11.880 --> 02:12.720
Shi Min said so,

02:12.760 --> 02:13.520
and the ping is right here.

02:14.200 --> 02:14.600
Let's hunt.

02:15.280 --> 02:15.880
Fan out.

02:16.360 --> 02:16.800
Hey man,

02:17.160 --> 02:18.440
seen a dude

02:18.440 --> 02:19.520
with massive ears?

02:19.640 --> 02:20.600
Stutters when he talks?

02:20.800 --> 02:21.760
Any new faces

02:21.760 --> 02:22.920
lately?

02:23.320 --> 02:23.800
Excuse me,

02:23.840 --> 02:24.560
seen a guy

02:24.600 --> 02:25.840
about my height?

02:25.920 --> 02:26.960
Stutters a bit?

02:27.280 --> 02:28.560
Big G!

02:29.280 --> 02:30.400
Yo, brother!

02:30.560 --> 02:32.400
Chill! You're screaming in my ear!

02:32.560 --> 02:33.400
I'm desperate...

02:33.600 --> 02:34.960
Big G! Yo!

02:37.120 --> 02:37.440
Qing Ye?

02:37.440 --> 02:37.800
Big...

02:38.680 --> 02:39.240
Wu!

02:39.840 --> 02:40.560
Big G!

02:40.680 --> 02:41.280
My man!

02:41.560 --> 02:42.280
Dude!

02:43.600 --> 02:45.560
Dude!

02:45.960 --> 02:47.040
You look

02:47.040 --> 02:48.360
absolutely wrecked!

02:48.720 --> 02:50.079
The hell is this?

02:50.840 --> 02:51.600
Chill,

02:51.720 --> 02:53.560
just doing some grunt work.

02:53.960 --> 02:56.160
You're here because of Shi Min, right?

02:56.840 --> 02:57.200
I...

02:57.720 --> 02:59.320
We did our homework before coming.

03:01.520 --> 03:02.840
Yep, she called it.

03:03.000 --> 03:03.720
Out of

03:03.720 --> 03:04.320
all these places,

03:04.320 --> 03:04.720
why would we

03:04.720 --> 03:05.600
come straight to this one?

03:08.680 --> 03:09.240
Alright, spill it.

03:10.200 --> 03:11.120
What's the deal?

03:14.120 --> 03:16.240
[Next week is my last.]

03:17.560 --> 03:18.800
[Dad's pulling me out of school.]

03:20.840 --> 03:21.560
Don't worry.

03:21.920 --> 03:23.400
We'll figure something out.

03:25.440 --> 03:26.040
G!

03:26.960 --> 03:27.520
Yo, G?

03:27.920 --> 03:28.680
Where'd he go...

03:28.680 --> 03:29.120
Mom.

03:30.600 --> 03:31.840
Jeez, you scared me!

03:31.920 --> 03:32.800
Homework done?

03:34.200 --> 03:35.520
I'm on it. Going right now.

03:35.640 --> 03:36.280
Drink this.

03:36.400 --> 03:37.280
It's to

03:37.360 --> 03:38.000
fix your stutter.

03:38.400 --> 03:40.320
What's this black sludge?

03:41.040 --> 03:41.680
A magic potion!

03:42.880 --> 03:44.640
Seriously, another one?

03:44.960 --> 03:46.120
Nah,

03:46.240 --> 03:47.240
your aunt

03:47.360 --> 03:49.040
sent this from Tianjin.

03:49.440 --> 03:51.000
Said it cures you

03:51.320 --> 03:52.880
in like three days.

03:53.040 --> 03:54.079
Bottoms up!

03:54.520 --> 03:55.440
You go ahead,

03:56.360 --> 03:57.000
I'll take it in a sec.

03:57.520 --> 03:58.320
No, chug it now.

03:58.360 --> 03:59.520
It loses the magic if it's cold.

03:59.720 --> 04:00.440
Don't spill it!

04:00.520 --> 04:01.760
Chug, chug, chug!

04:05.800 --> 04:07.000
Oh, and Mr. Zhu said

04:07.000 --> 04:07.840
your grades

04:07.840 --> 04:08.680
are in the toilet.

04:09.000 --> 04:09.720
What's the deal?

04:12.040 --> 04:13.240
I don't...

04:13.680 --> 04:14.920
Son, I'm not trying

04:15.640 --> 04:16.839
to ride you,

04:17.519 --> 04:19.200
but college exams are next year.

04:20.399 --> 04:21.839
If you keep failing,

04:22.240 --> 04:23.280
you're not getting

04:23.280 --> 04:24.560
into a good school.

04:24.600 --> 04:25.400
No degree,

04:25.440 --> 04:26.080
no job,

04:26.120 --> 04:27.240
no girlfriend.

04:27.240 --> 04:28.000
What then?

04:28.040 --> 04:29.200
You wanna rot

04:29.200 --> 04:30.320
in this town

04:30.320 --> 04:30.920
like your dad?

04:31.320 --> 04:32.600
My homework...

04:33.080 --> 04:34.240
[I don't know what to do.]

04:34.600 --> 04:36.200
[My dad won't agree...]

04:38.080 --> 04:38.880
A GIRL?

04:39.920 --> 04:40.159
It's not...

04:40.159 --> 04:40.880
What is she crying about?

04:40.960 --> 04:41.440
You heard wrong.

04:41.440 --> 04:42.120
WON'T AGREE?

04:42.400 --> 04:43.840
N-no, Mom, listen...

04:43.840 --> 04:44.400
No?

04:44.440 --> 04:45.400
No, listen...

04:45.680 --> 04:47.120
Are you dating someone?

04:47.280 --> 04:47.640
I...

04:47.720 --> 04:48.840
Your grades are tanking

04:48.920 --> 04:49.920
because of some chick!

04:50.000 --> 04:50.520
That's not...

04:50.520 --> 04:51.200
You can't even

04:51.200 --> 04:52.040
finish a sentence!

04:52.040 --> 04:53.120
What girl would even want you?

04:53.240 --> 04:53.960
You're setting yourself up

04:53.960 --> 04:55.159
for failure!

04:56.920 --> 04:57.880
I see.

04:58.400 --> 05:00.400
Shi Min's dad is pulling her out of school,

05:00.400 --> 05:01.280
you tried to intervene,

05:01.520 --> 05:02.440
and your mom assumed

05:02.720 --> 05:04.560
you guys were hooking up?

05:06.680 --> 05:08.280
So, overwhelmed by all the drama,

05:08.680 --> 05:09.440
you went off the grid

05:09.720 --> 05:10.600
to find her?

05:12.800 --> 05:15.160
I wasn't trying to act out.

05:15.680 --> 05:16.880
I just wanted to

05:16.880 --> 05:18.160
talk to her dad

05:18.800 --> 05:20.160
and stop him from making her quit.

05:20.640 --> 05:22.600
She couldn't even handle her own dad.

05:22.600 --> 05:23.560
What was your game plan?

05:24.040 --> 05:25.760
Qing Ye got him back,

05:25.800 --> 05:26.280
right?

05:26.280 --> 05:29.040
Why can't I?

05:31.720 --> 05:32.840
So, how did that go?

05:40.080 --> 05:40.640
Al-almost...

06:04.520 --> 06:05.960
Which one of you is Shi Jianguo?

06:13.880 --> 06:15.520
Get him out here now!

06:15.960 --> 06:17.000
Got a bone to pick with him!

06:21.000 --> 06:21.560
Excuse me,

06:22.400 --> 06:23.240
where's Shi Jianguo?

06:27.000 --> 06:27.680
Who's asking?

06:33.560 --> 06:34.200
Who are you,

06:34.560 --> 06:35.159
and what's your business?

06:36.040 --> 06:36.520
I... I...

06:38.520 --> 06:39.320
I...

06:40.840 --> 06:41.560
heard...

06:41.760 --> 06:42.880
Heard we needed extra hands,

06:42.880 --> 06:43.400
huh?

06:45.560 --> 06:46.760
A bit scrawny, but...

06:47.560 --> 06:48.840
screw it, you're hired.

06:50.040 --> 06:51.440
20 an hour,

06:51.760 --> 06:52.400
daily pay.

06:52.840 --> 06:54.320
Grab the fit.

06:56.320 --> 06:57.000
Grab it!

06:57.800 --> 06:58.360
Go earn your keep!

07:05.880 --> 07:06.360
"Almost,"

07:06.560 --> 07:07.960
huh?

07:08.160 --> 07:08.720
You were

07:08.720 --> 07:10.240
light-years away from succeeding!

07:10.560 --> 07:11.120
At least

07:11.240 --> 07:12.240
you made contact.

07:12.280 --> 07:12.840
And hey,

07:13.120 --> 07:14.720
you actually made a few bucks!

07:14.800 --> 07:15.320
Guys, stop...

07:16.000 --> 07:16.680
Qing Ye,

07:16.760 --> 07:18.280
you're the brain here.

07:18.960 --> 07:20.120
You gotta help Shi Min!

07:20.560 --> 07:21.600
Hey, new kid!

07:22.520 --> 07:23.640
Stop slacking!

07:23.640 --> 07:24.600
Speak of the devil...

07:28.240 --> 07:29.960
And you are...

07:31.120 --> 07:31.760
Hi, Mr. Shi.

07:31.760 --> 07:33.000
I'm Qing Ye,

07:33.040 --> 07:33.880
Shi Min's friend.

07:34.440 --> 07:34.840
Yeah,

07:34.920 --> 07:36.159
we go to school with her.

07:36.400 --> 07:37.520
Just wanted to talk.

07:37.960 --> 07:38.520
Talk?

07:39.640 --> 07:40.159
About what?

07:41.120 --> 07:42.400
If it's about school,

07:42.440 --> 07:43.440
forget it.

07:46.440 --> 07:46.800
Actually,

07:46.960 --> 07:47.320
Mr. Shi,

07:47.800 --> 07:49.120
we're here to pitch in.

07:49.320 --> 07:50.240
We know it's oyster season

07:50.240 --> 07:51.720
and you're slammed.

07:52.120 --> 07:53.080
We're locals,

07:53.240 --> 07:54.520
we know the drill.

07:55.400 --> 07:55.960
Put us to work!

07:56.360 --> 07:58.320
She never mentioned you.

07:58.360 --> 07:58.960
I thought she was

07:58.960 --> 08:00.320
a bit of a loner.

08:00.600 --> 08:02.040
Oh, not at all.

08:02.080 --> 08:03.040
She's incredibly sweet.

08:03.120 --> 08:04.400
We all love hanging out with her.

08:04.720 --> 08:05.080
Yeah!

08:05.520 --> 08:06.680
Guess she really is growing up...

08:06.720 --> 08:07.160
Dad!

08:08.240 --> 08:09.160
Guys...

08:09.320 --> 08:10.760
Classmates of yours?

08:11.120 --> 08:11.560
Yeah.

08:11.960 --> 08:13.200
Said they wanted to pitch in.

08:13.560 --> 08:14.000
Yep,

08:15.720 --> 08:16.240
can't wait!

08:17.400 --> 08:17.800
Cool.

08:17.960 --> 08:18.680
Walk with me.

08:19.680 --> 08:20.120
You too.

08:23.040 --> 08:23.760
What's the play?

08:24.240 --> 08:24.760
Just move.

08:24.880 --> 08:25.920
He's giving us chores.

08:26.600 --> 08:27.640
Work first, talk later.

08:27.720 --> 08:28.400
Play it by ear.

08:30.640 --> 08:31.520
Should we give Mr. Zhu

08:31.520 --> 08:32.200
a heads-up?

08:32.320 --> 08:33.280
Already pinged him.

08:48.840 --> 08:49.640
Hurry! Move!

08:49.680 --> 08:50.320
I'm hustling!

08:50.400 --> 08:51.160
Hey!

08:52.040 --> 08:52.720
Watch your step!

08:52.760 --> 08:53.400
Got it, got it!

08:55.280 --> 08:55.960
ETD?

08:56.400 --> 08:56.960
15 minutes.

08:56.960 --> 08:58.400
Mr. Zhu?

08:59.400 --> 08:59.760
Mr. Zhu,

08:59.760 --> 09:00.440
why are you here?

09:01.040 --> 09:02.000
What you doing here?

09:02.200 --> 09:02.720
Oh, wow.

09:02.920 --> 09:04.080
Are you...

09:04.240 --> 09:04.760
Going to Chang Island?

09:05.040 --> 09:05.920
Hurry, hurry!

09:05.960 --> 09:06.880
C'mon, ladies!

09:28.960 --> 09:29.840
So, real talk.

09:30.520 --> 09:31.520
What's the appeal?

09:34.760 --> 09:35.920
Don't start with me...

09:36.760 --> 09:38.360
Bro, it's fine.

09:38.720 --> 09:39.560
I got a crush on Ye-Ye,

09:39.560 --> 09:40.680
and I'm loud and proud about it.

09:41.800 --> 09:42.520
We're literally

09:42.520 --> 09:43.640
just friends.

09:44.240 --> 09:44.880
Who are you

09:46.000 --> 09:46.840
trying to fool?

09:47.920 --> 09:48.520
No, really.

09:49.120 --> 09:50.280
She gets my vibe.

09:51.400 --> 09:52.360
And I get hers.

09:53.960 --> 09:54.680
So, soul sisters.

09:56.440 --> 09:57.080
Pretty much.

09:58.720 --> 10:00.120
We've got the same tragic energy.

10:00.840 --> 10:02.520
No matter how hard we grind,

10:02.800 --> 10:03.640
we always lose.

10:04.840 --> 10:05.840
Helping her is

10:07.120 --> 10:08.080
my way of coping.

10:09.200 --> 10:10.200
How are you gonna pull that off?

10:12.000 --> 10:13.040
She wants to be an artist.

10:14.360 --> 10:15.840
Her dad said hell no. So...

10:16.520 --> 10:17.240
Art?

10:17.600 --> 10:18.840
Dude,

10:18.960 --> 10:20.280
you're a diner kid.

10:20.400 --> 10:21.600
You can't even draw.

10:22.080 --> 10:22.760
Plus,

10:22.800 --> 10:24.520
you can't even stand up to her dad...

10:24.880 --> 10:25.520
I didn't plan on

10:25.560 --> 10:26.880
being an oyster slave, OK?

10:28.680 --> 10:30.640
Chug some oysters

10:30.760 --> 10:31.640
and get swole, man.

10:32.080 --> 10:32.920
You turn into a nervous wreck

10:32.920 --> 10:33.560
around him.

10:36.160 --> 10:36.600
Whatever.

10:38.520 --> 10:39.400
You don't get it.

10:42.080 --> 10:43.280
Yes, I do.

10:44.520 --> 10:45.840
Look at me and Ye-Ye.

10:47.520 --> 10:48.320
I'm crazy about her,

10:49.400 --> 10:49.920
but I know

10:49.960 --> 10:50.680
she's light-years

10:50.680 --> 10:51.560
outta my league.

10:53.520 --> 10:54.640
Kids like us...

10:55.520 --> 10:56.640
we're lucky if we don't starve.

11:08.320 --> 11:09.800
Don't muscle it.

11:09.840 --> 11:10.680
It's about technique.

11:11.120 --> 11:12.520
Leverage your wrist

11:12.760 --> 11:13.520
and thumb,

11:14.040 --> 11:15.000
like this.

11:18.080 --> 11:18.560
Got it!

11:19.360 --> 11:19.920
Hey,

11:20.320 --> 11:21.920
is this your daily grind

11:22.320 --> 11:23.360
when you're not studying?

11:24.640 --> 11:26.200
Oysters used to be winter-only.

11:26.520 --> 11:27.520
But with tech upgrades,

11:27.520 --> 11:28.280
we do

11:28.360 --> 11:29.280
summer runs now.

11:29.680 --> 11:31.040
My family's been doing this

11:31.680 --> 11:32.680
forever.

11:33.960 --> 11:34.320
But...

11:35.520 --> 11:37.240
is this crazy amount your daily target?

11:37.440 --> 11:38.400
If you're quick,

11:38.400 --> 11:39.760
you can clear 20 pounds a day.

11:40.360 --> 11:41.560
Double this stack.

11:43.960 --> 11:45.240
Why shuck them?

11:45.360 --> 11:46.560
Why not sell them whole?

11:47.120 --> 11:48.760
Whole ones are only four a pound.

11:49.040 --> 11:50.800
Shucked ones fetch 20.

11:53.080 --> 11:54.360
COME AGAIN?

11:56.560 --> 11:58.720
In Beijing, they charge 20 for just one!

11:59.200 --> 11:59.920
That's insane!

12:00.560 --> 12:02.520
The markup is even worse

12:02.760 --> 12:03.520
in fancy spots.

12:05.600 --> 12:06.160
Must be some

12:06.160 --> 12:07.400
ultra-VIP restaurants.

12:09.360 --> 12:11.000
I knew they got

12:11.040 --> 12:11.720
marked up,

12:12.360 --> 12:13.760
but that's a whole different level...

12:16.200 --> 12:16.800
Shi Min...

12:18.280 --> 12:19.640
did you ever wanna

12:20.480 --> 12:21.440
get outta here

12:21.800 --> 12:22.880
and explore?

12:25.200 --> 12:26.200
Ain't got that privilege.

12:27.680 --> 12:28.520
Dad says

12:28.800 --> 12:29.640
school is pointless.

12:30.600 --> 12:31.320
And honestly,

12:32.080 --> 12:33.120
I study my butt off,

12:34.360 --> 12:35.520
and my grades still suck.

12:37.440 --> 12:38.640
Guess I'm stuck here

12:39.200 --> 12:39.640
like my dad,

12:39.640 --> 12:40.960
living the same loop:

12:41.600 --> 12:42.480
farming,

12:43.080 --> 12:43.840
harvesting,

12:44.800 --> 12:45.440
and shucking oysters forever.

12:46.720 --> 12:47.600
But

12:49.840 --> 12:51.560
what do you actually want?

12:55.640 --> 12:56.320
Um...

13:01.480 --> 13:02.800
I hate shucking oysters!

13:04.040 --> 13:05.280
I hate drying nets,

13:06.080 --> 13:06.920
and I hate gutting fish.

13:08.760 --> 13:09.360
So,

13:11.520 --> 13:13.000
what's your true passion?

13:14.120 --> 13:14.800
Painting...

13:17.120 --> 13:18.200
But that's never gonna happen.

13:46.800 --> 13:47.320
Mr. Shi,

13:48.160 --> 13:49.880
you run a massive operation here.

13:50.400 --> 13:51.400
Must be lucrative.

13:51.840 --> 13:53.720
Always this short-staffed?

13:55.680 --> 13:57.720
The money is solid,

13:58.680 --> 14:00.360
but harvest season

14:00.440 --> 14:01.440
is a nightmare.

14:01.800 --> 14:03.280
Most

14:03.400 --> 14:04.600
people here

14:04.600 --> 14:05.400
are seniors,

14:05.520 --> 14:06.360
and the kids

14:06.360 --> 14:07.360
all want to leave.

14:07.600 --> 14:09.120
On top of that,

14:09.240 --> 14:10.440
Min's sister just had a baby,

14:10.600 --> 14:12.200
so my wife's outta town.

14:12.600 --> 14:13.520
I had no choice but

14:13.520 --> 14:14.240
to draft Min.

14:18.040 --> 14:18.720
Look at

14:19.800 --> 14:21.520
all these awards.

14:21.920 --> 14:22.800
She's clearly

14:22.840 --> 14:23.680
got potential.

14:25.840 --> 14:27.600
She used to

14:27.640 --> 14:28.720
ace her classes.

14:29.080 --> 14:30.520
But in high school,

14:30.520 --> 14:31.640
she totally fell off the map.

14:32.160 --> 14:33.120
Our teachers say

14:33.160 --> 14:34.560
she tries really hard.

14:34.920 --> 14:37.320
Maybe she hasn't found her rhythm yet.

14:38.120 --> 14:39.320
Look, kid.

14:39.320 --> 14:40.720
You're too young to get it.

14:41.040 --> 14:42.000
Grinding in

14:42.240 --> 14:43.200
the wrong lane

14:43.200 --> 14:44.080
is a total waste

14:44.080 --> 14:45.720
of energy.

14:46.720 --> 14:48.400
Who else

14:48.400 --> 14:49.920
is gonna

14:50.200 --> 14:51.640
take over this place?

14:51.960 --> 14:52.920
Once she secures the bag,

14:52.920 --> 14:54.040
she can do whatever she wants.

14:57.560 --> 14:58.600
I might not know

14:58.600 --> 14:59.680
my calling yet,

15:00.880 --> 15:01.760
but I know

15:02.520 --> 15:03.280
this isn't

15:03.280 --> 15:04.280
where I belong.

15:05.240 --> 15:06.520
I wanna paint

15:06.520 --> 15:07.440
every single day,

15:08.360 --> 15:09.440
not live in

15:09.440 --> 15:10.240
a pile of seafood.

15:11.920 --> 15:12.600
Qing Ye,

15:13.960 --> 15:15.880
I wish I could explore the world...

15:38.320 --> 15:39.280
[You drew this?]

15:39.880 --> 15:40.920
[Neat!]

15:41.400 --> 15:42.720
[Just messing around...]

15:49.640 --> 15:50.360
I'm with you.

15:52.360 --> 15:52.840
See,

15:53.600 --> 15:55.360
your family is doing so well,

15:56.040 --> 15:56.920
they don't

15:57.280 --> 15:58.640
need you for the money.

15:59.600 --> 16:01.080
Why not have a real talk

16:02.440 --> 16:03.440
with your dad?

16:04.120 --> 16:06.160
Ask him to let you follow your dream.

16:08.280 --> 16:09.080
But my dad thinks

16:09.080 --> 16:10.720
art is a joke.

16:11.360 --> 16:12.520
He wants me to

16:12.520 --> 16:13.280
stick to oysters.

16:13.840 --> 16:15.520
Art is so not a joke!

16:15.880 --> 16:17.360
Artists have so many

16:17.360 --> 16:18.280
career paths!

16:18.520 --> 16:19.640
You can go into architecture,

16:20.440 --> 16:21.200
fashion...

16:22.320 --> 16:23.080
Oh,

16:23.680 --> 16:25.400
or teaching!

16:26.280 --> 16:26.760
I know...

16:27.560 --> 16:28.240
Qing Ye,

16:28.840 --> 16:29.680
will you help me

16:29.720 --> 16:30.800
change his mind?

16:33.440 --> 16:34.040
We'll get him

16:34.680 --> 16:35.520
on board.

16:36.560 --> 16:37.200
You're the best.

16:46.200 --> 16:46.760
Here, use this.

16:47.760 --> 16:48.240
What's this?

16:48.760 --> 16:49.200
Clam balm.

16:49.680 --> 16:50.840
Prevents cracking.

16:51.200 --> 16:52.520
It's all-natural.

16:52.760 --> 16:54.360
A local skin hack.

17:00.760 --> 17:01.840
Smells awful,

17:02.160 --> 17:03.320
but it's legit.

17:10.720 --> 17:11.520
Too little.

17:11.800 --> 17:12.560
Gotta be thicker.

17:13.800 --> 17:14.319
Here.

17:16.920 --> 17:18.319
Let me.

17:21.720 --> 17:23.280
Like this. All over.

17:34.640 --> 17:35.080
Alright.

17:41.400 --> 17:41.880
Yours now.

17:51.200 --> 17:51.920
Xing Wu,

17:53.240 --> 17:54.680
let me see your hands.

17:56.120 --> 17:56.640
Why?

18:17.520 --> 18:18.520
Shi Min said

18:19.240 --> 18:20.360
calluses are like

18:20.880 --> 18:22.160
a local trademark here.

18:24.600 --> 18:25.680
Coastal life.

18:26.520 --> 18:28.000
Shucking is a killer.

18:28.400 --> 18:30.120
In their old age, these ladies

18:30.320 --> 18:30.960
can't even

18:31.360 --> 18:32.320
unbend their fingers.

18:34.840 --> 18:36.520
People think beach life is a vibe,

18:37.440 --> 18:38.520
but it's actually brutal.

18:39.120 --> 18:40.440
That's why

18:41.040 --> 18:42.240
I need to help Shi Min.

18:44.200 --> 18:45.680
Mr. Zhu should make you his official

18:45.720 --> 18:47.400
"Stay-in-School" Ambassador.

18:49.000 --> 18:50.240
They only return

18:50.400 --> 18:52.120
if they wanted to anyway.

18:54.200 --> 18:54.920
Just like you,

18:57.080 --> 18:57.600
right?

19:00.720 --> 19:01.600
I had a beautiful

19:02.600 --> 19:03.200
incentive.

19:32.520 --> 19:33.280
Big G!

19:34.000 --> 19:34.960
G!

19:37.360 --> 19:38.320
My son!

19:39.200 --> 19:40.040
Mama's here!

19:40.680 --> 19:41.720
Big G!

19:44.240 --> 19:44.800
Easy.

19:45.360 --> 19:46.320
G! Oh, G!

19:47.880 --> 19:49.600
You nearly gave me a heart attack!

19:49.880 --> 19:50.520
Auntie!

19:51.800 --> 19:52.440
Sweet jesus...

19:53.240 --> 19:53.840
Kids are fine.

19:53.880 --> 19:54.440
Aye, aye!

19:54.880 --> 19:55.560
Auntie...

19:56.280 --> 19:56.920
Kyle?

19:57.840 --> 19:58.840
Why didn't you guys

19:58.880 --> 20:00.040
say anything before leaving?

20:00.040 --> 20:01.680
You worried everyone sick!

20:02.240 --> 20:02.960
My bad.

20:03.240 --> 20:03.720
Sorry.

20:04.280 --> 20:04.960
Where's Kyle?

20:05.160 --> 20:05.920
Is he here?

20:05.920 --> 20:06.800
The gang's all here.

20:06.880 --> 20:07.640
Kyle!

20:08.520 --> 20:09.240
Kyle?

20:09.760 --> 20:10.960
Yesterday was on me.

20:11.760 --> 20:12.800
I shouldn't have yelled.

20:13.600 --> 20:15.200
From now on, you do you.

20:15.320 --> 20:17.000
No more gross sludge.

20:17.200 --> 20:18.520
Just don't

20:18.560 --> 20:19.600
ghost me again,

20:19.600 --> 20:20.160
please?

20:20.440 --> 20:21.840
I wasn't running away.

20:22.440 --> 20:23.040
I was just

20:23.120 --> 20:24.480
backing up a friend.

20:24.560 --> 20:25.880
I got you.

20:26.320 --> 20:27.120
I'll believe

20:27.120 --> 20:28.080
whatever you say.

20:28.200 --> 20:28.920
I'm sorry,

20:29.040 --> 20:29.960
OK?

20:30.520 --> 20:31.280
C'mon, Ma.

20:31.520 --> 20:32.440
Go sit down.

20:32.600 --> 20:34.240
Where's my kid...

20:41.400 --> 20:42.120
Oh, you little punk!

20:42.160 --> 20:42.840
You think

20:42.880 --> 20:43.760
you're slick?!

20:43.760 --> 20:44.560
Mom, wait! Chill!

20:44.880 --> 20:45.600
Let me explain!

20:45.720 --> 20:46.520
Explain to my hand!

20:46.560 --> 20:47.320
You hijacked the boat!

20:47.400 --> 20:48.360
Are you trying to

20:48.400 --> 20:49.440
get killed?!

20:49.600 --> 20:50.240
Keep slapping me,

20:50.360 --> 20:51.280
and I'm

20:51.400 --> 20:52.160
packing my bags

20:52.200 --> 20:52.760
for real!

20:52.920 --> 20:54.040
Oh, you wanna pack your bags?

20:54.200 --> 20:55.000
I'll pack you little...

20:55.360 --> 20:56.080
Help!

20:57.320 --> 20:58.160
Aunt Fen, chill, chill...

20:58.160 --> 20:58.560
Break it up!

20:58.560 --> 20:59.360
That was on me.

20:59.440 --> 21:00.520
We couldn't wait around for the ferry,

21:00.520 --> 21:01.640
so we just took off.

21:02.000 --> 21:02.440
Wu,

21:02.840 --> 21:04.120
don't sweat it,

21:04.400 --> 21:05.400
you're fine.

21:05.640 --> 21:06.840
I know you're solid.

21:07.040 --> 21:07.640
But this punk?

21:07.800 --> 21:09.200
I'm ending him today!

21:09.280 --> 21:09.840
Get your ass

21:10.040 --> 21:10.640
back here!

21:10.680 --> 21:11.120
Stop!

21:11.120 --> 21:12.040
Go easy on him!

21:12.200 --> 21:12.680
Yeah, promise.

21:12.680 --> 21:13.920
He is dead meat!

21:14.120 --> 21:14.680
Kyle,

21:15.040 --> 21:15.720
get back here!

21:16.840 --> 21:17.960
Look at you, tough guy.

21:18.160 --> 21:19.040
Your idea, huh?

21:19.680 --> 21:20.400
It was nothing.

21:21.240 --> 21:21.800
Auntie,

21:21.880 --> 21:23.160
I even learned how to shuck oysters!

21:24.040 --> 21:24.920
OK, show-off!

21:25.080 --> 21:26.200
Don't pull a stunt like this again.

21:27.240 --> 21:27.720
Oh cr*p!

21:28.000 --> 21:28.720
Mr. Zhu...

21:28.760 --> 21:29.240
C'mon, kids.

21:29.280 --> 21:29.640
Mr. Zhu!

21:29.680 --> 21:30.200
He's barfing his guts out.

21:30.200 --> 21:30.560
Mr. Zhu...

21:30.560 --> 21:31.240
I'll live...

21:31.560 --> 21:32.520
Seasick?

21:32.560 --> 21:33.560
On a literal

21:33.560 --> 21:34.560
open raft?

21:37.560 --> 21:38.520
Just get it all out.

21:40.560 --> 21:41.120
G,

21:43.000 --> 21:43.960
I thought through it

21:44.560 --> 21:45.520
on the boat.

21:45.840 --> 21:47.320
I shouldn't project my anxiety

21:47.360 --> 21:48.320
onto you.

21:49.440 --> 21:50.440
You deserve to

21:50.440 --> 21:51.520
live your life

21:52.480 --> 21:53.840
on your own terms.

21:56.200 --> 21:56.720
G,

21:58.200 --> 21:59.360
I messed up.

22:02.040 --> 22:02.880
I'm sorry.

22:08.000 --> 22:08.480
Mom,

22:09.520 --> 22:10.040
chill.

22:11.000 --> 22:12.120
I'll make you proud.

22:13.360 --> 22:14.040
I'm gonna crush

22:16.000 --> 22:17.440
college exams for you.

22:20.680 --> 22:21.080
Go.

22:21.240 --> 22:22.440
I'm good, totally good!

22:22.920 --> 22:23.800
Help her dad understand

22:24.240 --> 22:25.320
so she can go back.

22:25.360 --> 22:26.680
Yeah, a loyal friend.

22:26.800 --> 22:27.440
Good.

22:27.960 --> 22:28.360
Good.

22:30.080 --> 22:30.960
Mr. Zhu?

22:31.240 --> 22:32.200
Can't believe you're here.

22:32.360 --> 22:33.160
Here, stay hydrated.

22:33.280 --> 22:34.400
Mrs. Xing, have one.

22:34.400 --> 22:35.200
Thanks, sweetie.

22:36.440 --> 22:37.520
She your classmate?

22:37.880 --> 22:38.240
Yeah,

22:38.400 --> 22:38.880
Shi Min.

22:39.360 --> 22:40.360
Big G's main...

22:40.520 --> 22:41.240
Here you go, ma'am.

22:42.240 --> 22:42.880
You're so sweet!

22:43.160 --> 22:45.120
Mom, Shi Min, the friend

22:45.200 --> 22:45.640
I'm helping.

22:47.720 --> 22:48.440
What a

22:48.440 --> 22:49.400
sweet girl.

22:50.400 --> 22:51.200
They kinda

22:51.680 --> 22:53.560
look like a cute couple, huh?

22:55.160 --> 22:56.240
Oh, hush!

22:56.400 --> 22:57.720
They're just

22:57.960 --> 22:58.680
classmates.

22:59.360 --> 23:00.520
Sure, "classmates." I get it!

23:01.640 --> 23:02.840
Hey, we're already here

23:03.000 --> 23:04.040
and have nowhere to be.

23:04.720 --> 23:06.240
Let's show Shi Min how it's done!

23:06.560 --> 23:07.280
Mr. Zhu, please,

23:07.320 --> 23:08.240
you don't have to.

23:08.640 --> 23:09.240
Oh,

23:09.360 --> 23:10.360
stop it.

23:10.520 --> 23:11.920
We can

23:11.920 --> 23:12.760
do this

23:12.760 --> 23:14.040
in our sleep!

23:14.120 --> 23:14.720
Right, ladies?

23:14.800 --> 23:15.880
Let the kids chill for a bit.

23:16.000 --> 23:16.400
Yeah.

23:16.520 --> 23:17.680
Let's get to work, ladies.

23:17.680 --> 23:18.280
Yeah,

23:18.520 --> 23:18.840
let's go!

23:18.840 --> 23:19.320
Thanks, everyone.

23:25.960 --> 23:26.720
D*mn,

23:27.160 --> 23:28.400
these oysters are top-tier!

23:28.520 --> 23:29.080
Massive

23:29.200 --> 23:29.720
and juicy.

23:31.680 --> 23:33.240
Oysters are superfoods.

23:33.560 --> 23:34.280
Oh, definitely.

23:34.960 --> 23:36.120
A performance booster for him,

23:36.360 --> 23:37.520
and a beauty hack for her.

23:38.000 --> 23:39.120
Ooh, you'd better take a whole bucket

23:39.120 --> 23:40.080
to your man!

23:46.080 --> 23:46.600
Oh, shoot...

23:47.400 --> 23:48.000
You good,

23:48.640 --> 23:49.200
Mr. Zhu?

23:49.880 --> 23:50.880
My bad...

23:51.800 --> 23:53.000
All good, I'll take care of it.

23:54.040 --> 23:54.520
Look,

23:54.800 --> 23:55.680
I appreciate

23:56.280 --> 23:57.360
the hustle,

23:57.600 --> 23:58.240
but please sit this one out.

23:58.680 --> 23:59.360
No, I insist.

23:59.920 --> 24:00.760
If I slack off,

24:01.560 --> 24:02.160
my kids will

24:02.840 --> 24:03.520
have to work

24:03.560 --> 24:04.280
twice as hard.

24:04.560 --> 24:05.720
Real talk,

24:06.160 --> 24:07.520
you're not helping.

24:07.640 --> 24:09.160
You're actually

24:09.280 --> 24:10.080
slowing me down.

24:10.880 --> 24:11.840
Hey,

24:13.080 --> 24:14.640
are you seriously

24:14.640 --> 24:15.680
pulling her out of school?

24:17.880 --> 24:19.880
You do know tuition

24:19.880 --> 24:20.680
is non-refundable, right?

24:21.520 --> 24:22.560
It's cool.

24:22.880 --> 24:24.000
Just pocket change.

24:24.920 --> 24:26.640
But with her grades,

24:26.680 --> 24:28.680
she doesn't stand a chance at college.

24:29.080 --> 24:30.560
Why waste time in school

24:30.600 --> 24:31.840
when she could be earning a living?

24:33.880 --> 24:34.440
True.

24:35.520 --> 24:36.080
Look,

24:36.200 --> 24:36.800
this place

24:37.240 --> 24:38.720
is huge.

24:39.920 --> 24:40.800
You must be

24:40.880 --> 24:42.160
drowning in work, right?

24:43.920 --> 24:44.800
Tell me about it.

24:45.200 --> 24:46.280
I ran myself

24:46.360 --> 24:47.760
into the ground when I was young.

24:47.880 --> 24:48.840
Now my body is

24:48.920 --> 24:49.960
paying the price.

24:50.880 --> 24:51.800
Honestly,

24:51.800 --> 24:52.600
my health is just

24:52.600 --> 24:53.880
going downhill fast!

24:54.400 --> 24:55.200
Please, you're not that old.

24:56.560 --> 24:58.520
But Min is a girl.

24:58.840 --> 24:59.600
You really want her

25:00.120 --> 25:01.400
doing this brutal manual labor?

25:01.960 --> 25:02.680
Look,

25:03.120 --> 25:04.480
I'm a dad.

25:04.840 --> 25:06.040
If she could actually make it

25:06.360 --> 25:07.520
in the academic world,

25:07.520 --> 25:08.560
I'd let her go.

25:08.640 --> 25:09.880
But she's just not cut out for books.

25:10.280 --> 25:11.320
Hell no!

25:12.720 --> 25:14.000
Min's art is fire,

25:14.120 --> 25:15.480
and she's

25:15.520 --> 25:16.240
passionate.

25:17.600 --> 25:18.600
Ever thought about

25:18.920 --> 25:20.160
putting her in

25:20.200 --> 25:21.080
fine arts?

25:22.840 --> 25:24.080
Fine arts...

25:25.680 --> 25:27.920
We're fishermen, bro.

25:28.000 --> 25:29.640
None of us are artists.

25:30.000 --> 25:30.920
There's always a first!

25:32.680 --> 25:33.520
You know,

25:33.800 --> 25:34.640
colleges cut

25:34.720 --> 25:36.440
art students a lot of

25:36.880 --> 25:37.600
slack!

25:38.160 --> 25:39.800
If her portfolio

25:39.960 --> 25:40.840
is top-tier,

25:41.160 --> 25:42.160
the grade cutoff

25:42.200 --> 25:43.240
is way lower.

25:43.400 --> 25:44.240
For real?

25:45.680 --> 25:46.960
But if she still

25:46.960 --> 25:48.600
tanks the exams,

25:48.880 --> 25:50.600
isn't it just a waste of time?

25:51.720 --> 25:52.600
Oh, please!

25:53.080 --> 25:54.520
How is education

25:54.520 --> 25:55.520
a waste of time?

25:56.520 --> 25:57.920
Look at Xing Wu,

25:57.920 --> 25:58.680
the tall kid

25:59.440 --> 26:00.720
who fixed your setup.

26:01.800 --> 26:03.480
He took a two-year leave,

26:03.640 --> 26:05.240
and I still got him back

26:05.240 --> 26:05.800
in class!

26:05.920 --> 26:06.880
Two years?

26:08.920 --> 26:10.080
Dang, that kid's

26:10.160 --> 26:11.760
got balls!

26:11.840 --> 26:12.600
Right?

26:13.320 --> 26:14.520
Because at the end of the day,

26:14.960 --> 26:16.040
my job is to teach them

26:16.080 --> 26:17.240
not to back down

26:17.240 --> 26:17.800
from life.

26:18.600 --> 26:19.240
Honestly,

26:19.720 --> 26:21.120
I've taught

26:21.600 --> 26:23.320
countless kids.

26:24.200 --> 26:25.080
I can't guarantee

26:25.120 --> 26:26.240
everyone becomes

26:26.320 --> 26:27.200
successful.

26:28.320 --> 26:29.000
But

26:29.800 --> 26:31.640
I do make sure

26:32.120 --> 26:34.800
they follow their hearts

26:35.440 --> 26:36.360
and live a life

26:36.400 --> 26:38.120
they won't regret.

26:51.880 --> 26:53.040
A toast!

26:53.640 --> 26:54.760
Everyone here

26:54.760 --> 26:56.440
is family to my girl.

26:56.520 --> 26:57.080
Big thanks to

26:57.160 --> 26:58.160
Mr. Zhu and

26:58.320 --> 26:59.600
our three lovely ladies

27:00.440 --> 27:01.880
for helping us

27:01.880 --> 27:02.600
out.

27:02.600 --> 27:04.640
I am truly grateful to you all.

27:05.160 --> 27:05.840
I'm not

27:05.840 --> 27:06.520
big on speeches,

27:06.520 --> 27:07.520
so let's just feast,

27:08.000 --> 27:09.600
and have fun!

27:10.080 --> 27:10.760
Bottoms up!

27:10.960 --> 27:11.840
Thanks!

27:11.880 --> 27:12.960
Cheers, everyone!

27:12.960 --> 27:13.680
Come on!

27:14.600 --> 27:14.960
Here.

27:17.920 --> 27:18.400
Mr. Zhu.

27:19.640 --> 27:20.800
- To you, Mr. Zhu!
- Dig in, everyone!

27:23.920 --> 27:24.560
Thanks!

27:26.120 --> 27:26.880
Grab a shrimp!

27:27.000 --> 27:27.520
Yeah.

27:29.040 --> 27:29.720
Thanks.

27:29.840 --> 27:30.600
Thank you!

27:30.840 --> 27:32.160
Hiring is a nightmare lately.

27:32.240 --> 27:33.040
Even with good pay,

27:33.800 --> 27:35.240
no one wants to grind.

27:36.280 --> 27:37.720
You guys literally saved me today,

27:37.920 --> 27:39.160
especially this trio right here.

27:39.240 --> 27:41.080
You absolute pros!

27:42.720 --> 27:43.440
Come on,

27:43.520 --> 27:44.520
cut the

27:44.760 --> 27:46.120
politeness.

27:46.600 --> 27:47.920
No need for that.

27:48.280 --> 27:49.360
My husband

27:49.400 --> 27:50.360
is the same way

27:50.520 --> 27:52.080
during peak fishing season!

27:52.280 --> 27:52.840
Just like you.

27:52.880 --> 27:54.280
We just gotta survive the rush, right?

27:54.280 --> 27:55.040
Exactly.

27:55.280 --> 27:56.200
We didn't know

27:56.200 --> 27:57.800
the kids were this tight.

27:58.040 --> 27:59.040
We would've teamed up

27:59.120 --> 28:00.280
to help you weeks ago.

28:00.400 --> 28:01.160
Yeah!

28:01.160 --> 28:01.640
Appreciate it!

28:01.720 --> 28:02.960
My boy has

28:03.080 --> 28:04.440
a heart of gold.

28:05.200 --> 28:07.240
I gave him such a hard time

28:07.520 --> 28:08.520
when he was just helping a friend.

28:09.000 --> 28:10.080
He's a great kid!

28:10.160 --> 28:10.520
C'mon.

28:10.520 --> 28:11.240
Solid kid.

28:11.520 --> 28:13.320
We all have our bad days.

28:13.600 --> 28:15.160
But squad up, and it's easy, right?

28:15.800 --> 28:16.960
Need more hands

28:16.960 --> 28:17.760
next time?

28:17.760 --> 28:18.600
Just call us.

28:18.640 --> 28:19.880
We'll show up, guaranteed.

28:20.080 --> 28:21.560
Appreciate it, appreciate it.

28:23.120 --> 28:24.120
Thanks for

28:24.200 --> 28:25.360
looking out for my girl.

28:26.320 --> 28:27.280
Though,

28:27.320 --> 28:28.280
I see what's actually happening.

28:28.600 --> 28:30.120
This isn't just about oysters,

28:30.240 --> 28:31.160
is it, Mr. Zhu?

28:33.160 --> 28:34.800
Alright, cards on the table.

28:35.120 --> 28:37.160
Girl, your turn.

28:37.800 --> 28:38.520
Do you

28:38.920 --> 28:39.800
actually want back in?

28:51.960 --> 28:52.680
Listen, baldy!

28:52.840 --> 28:54.160
I'm dropping facts now!

28:57.640 --> 28:58.720
I wanna

28:59.360 --> 29:00.520
go to school!

29:00.840 --> 29:02.120
I have to!

29:08.800 --> 29:10.000
You say my grades are trash,

29:10.200 --> 29:11.760
but I grind every single day!

29:12.800 --> 29:13.840
You say I'll never make it as an artist.

29:14.280 --> 29:14.640
OK,

29:14.920 --> 29:15.520
but art isn't

29:15.520 --> 29:17.040
a dead-end job!

29:17.360 --> 29:18.160
I can

29:18.600 --> 29:19.760
teach!

29:20.520 --> 29:21.400
I can do design!

29:21.840 --> 29:23.560
I can do a million things!

29:24.960 --> 29:25.400
Preach!

29:25.720 --> 29:26.120
Hell yeah!

29:27.840 --> 29:28.400
So proud of you!

29:28.680 --> 29:29.760
Hold on, I'm not done!

29:30.200 --> 29:31.080
Take your time, babe.

29:32.800 --> 29:33.520
Dad...

29:34.440 --> 29:36.000
I wanna leave this tiny town.

29:36.560 --> 29:37.840
I wanna go to college

29:37.880 --> 29:39.600
and do what I actually love.

29:40.920 --> 29:41.600
I wanna

29:41.600 --> 29:42.840
see the world...

29:52.280 --> 29:52.680
Good!

29:52.880 --> 29:53.320
Attagirl!

29:54.160 --> 29:54.640
Attagirl!

29:54.680 --> 29:54.920
Yeah!

29:55.520 --> 29:56.320
Woohoo!

30:00.080 --> 30:02.240
But prepping

30:02.720 --> 30:04.680
for exams

30:04.800 --> 30:05.640
while doing art?

30:05.720 --> 30:06.520
That's double

30:06.560 --> 30:07.640
the grind.

30:08.000 --> 30:09.720
What if you still tank

30:09.840 --> 30:10.520
your grades?

30:11.280 --> 30:12.200
I've got her back!

30:12.400 --> 30:12.960
Trust me,

30:13.360 --> 30:15.200
I'm tutoring her.

30:15.360 --> 30:16.880
We've got over 200 days until graduation.

30:17.160 --> 30:18.400
We're locked in!

30:18.840 --> 30:19.280
Attagirl!

30:20.000 --> 30:20.400
Y'know,

30:20.720 --> 30:22.120
she's the top student.

30:22.720 --> 30:23.280
And

30:23.400 --> 30:24.000
worst-case scenario,

30:24.000 --> 30:25.120
she's still got me.

30:25.560 --> 30:26.560
Don't worry

30:27.160 --> 30:28.840
about her grades,

30:29.120 --> 30:29.880
we've still

30:30.080 --> 30:30.600
got time.

30:30.640 --> 30:31.000
Sir,

30:31.640 --> 30:33.120
our hometowns are great.

30:33.440 --> 30:34.400
But if we stay here

30:34.400 --> 30:35.040
forever,

30:35.280 --> 30:36.160
we're just repeating

30:36.200 --> 30:37.040
the cycle.

30:37.560 --> 30:40.080
If you let her take this leap,

30:40.440 --> 30:41.800
it opens up a whole new world

30:41.920 --> 30:42.720
of possibilities.

30:49.320 --> 30:50.600
Screw it, I'm down!

30:53.160 --> 30:53.720
No way!

30:53.720 --> 30:54.120
C'mon.

30:54.600 --> 30:55.120
He's on board!

30:55.120 --> 30:56.440
Get your drinks up!

30:56.960 --> 30:57.440
Awesome!

30:57.440 --> 30:58.200
You're serious, Dad?

30:58.320 --> 30:59.000
Dead serious!

30:59.120 --> 30:59.720
Aww, dry those eyes.

30:59.720 --> 31:01.040
Welcome back to the grind!

31:01.080 --> 31:01.400
Cheers!

31:01.400 --> 31:02.760
Let's chug!

31:02.840 --> 31:05.840
Cheers!

31:05.840 --> 31:07.000
Congrats, girl!

31:07.200 --> 31:07.760
Cheers!

31:10.600 --> 31:11.560
C'mon, eat!

31:28.120 --> 31:29.360
Didn't know Big G

31:29.440 --> 31:30.800
had hidden talents!

31:31.920 --> 31:33.480
He actually wanted to

31:33.520 --> 31:34.520
learn the piano.

31:37.000 --> 31:38.800
Piano?

31:39.280 --> 31:40.800
That's a wild leap!

31:41.720 --> 31:42.440
His mom was like:

31:43.280 --> 31:44.160
"they both have keys,

31:44.240 --> 31:45.520
close enough."

31:47.360 --> 31:48.360
Down here,

31:48.880 --> 31:50.280
music won't put food on the table.

31:58.080 --> 31:58.800
But I see things

31:59.200 --> 31:59.840
differently now.

32:02.960 --> 32:04.320
This summer

32:05.320 --> 32:05.960
changed

32:06.000 --> 32:06.920
everything for me.

32:25.560 --> 32:26.360
Maybe

32:27.240 --> 32:28.400
to Shi Min,

32:29.080 --> 32:30.240
piano

32:30.760 --> 32:33.200
or harmonica...

32:33.400 --> 32:34.040
it's all the same.

32:37.680 --> 32:39.080
Having someone who gets you

32:40.360 --> 32:40.920
is a blessing.

32:45.760 --> 32:46.600
To me,

32:47.080 --> 32:47.960
you're that blessing.

33:12.240 --> 33:13.040
This is pure bliss!

33:14.960 --> 33:15.880
Pure bliss!

33:58.520 --> 33:59.040
They've got moves!

33:59.120 --> 33:59.680
Slay!

34:07.520 --> 34:08.440
Come on!

34:08.719 --> 34:09.440
Join us!

34:09.960 --> 34:12.120
Get up and shake it!

34:12.400 --> 34:13.040
Don't just stand there!

34:13.040 --> 34:13.600
Let's go!

34:15.040 --> 34:16.000
C'mon Mr. Zhu!

34:16.199 --> 34:17.360
Hype it up!

34:17.600 --> 34:18.719
Squad up,

34:18.800 --> 34:19.440
let's go!

34:19.639 --> 34:20.639
Join the fun!

34:23.800 --> 34:24.159
Dance!

34:24.679 --> 34:25.080
Don't be shy!

34:26.520 --> 34:27.120
Learn from the pros, kids!

34:44.159 --> 34:46.000
[Life is a]

34:46.000 --> 34:47.560
[one-time ride.]

34:48.560 --> 34:50.440
[No do-overs, no rewind.]

34:51.320 --> 34:52.560
[So when you]

34:53.239 --> 34:55.159
[make a move,]

34:55.360 --> 34:57.240
[make it count.]

34:58.000 --> 34:59.280
[Live with zero regrets.]

35:00.280 --> 35:01.360
[If you mess up,]

35:01.360 --> 35:02.280
[don't sweat it.]

35:02.600 --> 35:03.520
[Learn from it,]

35:04.000 --> 35:05.720
[patch it up,]

35:07.160 --> 35:09.040
[and if it's out of your hands,]

35:09.440 --> 35:10.640
[just let it be.]

35:11.040 --> 35:11.880
[Quit dwelling on the past,]

35:12.520 --> 35:14.280
[and keep chasing]

35:14.680 --> 35:15.880
[your wildest dreams!]

35:36.000 --> 35:37.120
Thanks a ton!

35:37.920 --> 35:38.560
That was fun!

35:38.680 --> 35:39.600
Thank you!

35:39.640 --> 35:40.640
Appreciate it, boss!

35:41.200 --> 35:42.440
Nah, you guys are the real heroes.

35:42.760 --> 35:43.840
Take these.

35:43.920 --> 35:44.800
We don't have fancy stuff here,

35:44.960 --> 35:45.680
but we've got seafood for days!

35:46.160 --> 35:46.920
Oh wow,

35:46.920 --> 35:47.840
look at this haul!

35:48.040 --> 35:48.720
Seriously,

35:48.760 --> 35:50.120
you should stay longer!

35:50.160 --> 35:51.080
I would,

35:51.120 --> 35:52.400
but I've got family duties

35:52.440 --> 35:54.240
back home.

35:54.400 --> 35:55.400
But we're leaving

35:55.400 --> 35:56.240
the kids with you.

35:56.240 --> 35:57.280
They can cover

35:57.520 --> 35:58.280
some shifts

35:58.280 --> 35:59.360
and wind down a bit.

35:59.600 --> 36:00.640
Next time,

36:00.920 --> 36:01.640
bring

36:01.680 --> 36:02.760
the whole family.

36:03.240 --> 36:04.000
It's all on my tab!

36:04.040 --> 36:04.840
Awesome! Deal!

36:04.840 --> 36:05.440
Sounds like a plan!

36:06.080 --> 36:06.880
Mr. Zhu,

36:07.120 --> 36:07.920
ladies...

36:08.640 --> 36:09.720
Sorry for all the drama!

36:10.400 --> 36:11.800
We've got

36:11.920 --> 36:13.520
each other's backs.

36:13.720 --> 36:14.080
No stress, sweetie!

36:14.600 --> 36:15.360
Honestly,

36:15.600 --> 36:16.280
your girl is

36:16.440 --> 36:17.320
a total class act!

36:17.320 --> 36:17.960
She's the best.

36:18.040 --> 36:18.400
Yeah.

36:18.680 --> 36:19.400
G,

36:20.080 --> 36:20.920
don't be a slacker!

36:21.320 --> 36:21.880
Sure, Mom!

36:22.200 --> 36:22.640
Wu,

36:23.520 --> 36:25.000
take care of her.

36:25.040 --> 36:25.400
Don't worry.

36:25.920 --> 36:26.600
I got her.

36:26.840 --> 36:27.360
Attaboy!

36:29.440 --> 36:30.280
Yo, moms,

36:30.280 --> 36:31.040
wrap it up!

36:31.520 --> 36:32.120
Gotta drive

36:32.120 --> 36:33.000
y'all back home!

36:33.000 --> 36:33.600
Coming, sweetie.

36:33.640 --> 36:34.920
Back in two days,

36:34.920 --> 36:35.640
Auntie.

36:35.640 --> 36:36.240
Take care of yourselves!

36:36.360 --> 36:37.160
Chop chop,

36:37.160 --> 36:37.600
let's hit the road!

36:37.680 --> 36:38.160
See ya!

36:38.240 --> 36:38.880
Drive safe!

36:39.400 --> 36:40.000
Bye, guys!

36:40.000 --> 36:40.640
Bye, Mom!

36:40.680 --> 36:41.040
Later!

36:41.120 --> 36:41.800
Drive safe!

36:49.640 --> 36:50.160
Alright kids, let's head back.

37:14.080 --> 37:14.720
A penny for your thoughts?

37:17.200 --> 37:18.160
My dad.

37:23.440 --> 37:24.000
Tell me?

37:25.800 --> 37:27.280
Only if you want to,

37:27.360 --> 37:27.800
though.

37:30.840 --> 37:31.880
It's fine.

37:34.280 --> 37:35.160
He was

37:35.640 --> 37:36.560
basically

37:37.360 --> 37:39.760
an absentee dad,

37:41.800 --> 37:43.080
except when

37:43.520 --> 37:45.040
he wanted to control me.

37:45.640 --> 37:47.040
He'd "gift"

37:47.400 --> 37:49.080
my mom and me stuff,

37:49.520 --> 37:50.560
but he just had

37:50.560 --> 37:51.520
his secretary

37:51.560 --> 37:52.720
buy them.

37:52.880 --> 37:53.640
Total fake gesture.

37:54.720 --> 37:55.800
I mean, what kinda dad

37:56.160 --> 37:57.560
gets his teenage daughter

37:58.000 --> 37:59.520
Louboutins?

38:01.280 --> 38:02.200
Maybe

38:03.080 --> 38:03.960
he thought you were

38:03.960 --> 38:05.360
ready to flex them?

38:06.840 --> 38:07.560
Please.

38:09.160 --> 38:11.080
He was fooling around

38:11.080 --> 38:12.320
with his staff.

38:12.680 --> 38:13.840
His side chicks

38:14.160 --> 38:15.760
picked them out

38:16.120 --> 38:17.080
just to throw shade at my mom.

38:19.040 --> 38:20.680
After she died,

38:20.720 --> 38:22.360
they all scrambled

38:22.400 --> 38:23.200
to lock him down.

38:23.400 --> 38:24.240
But once

38:24.840 --> 38:25.880
his company went bust,

38:26.400 --> 38:27.880
they ghosted immediately.

38:28.520 --> 38:30.040
Hilarious, right?

38:35.280 --> 38:36.440
Any updates

38:36.640 --> 38:37.560
on him?

38:39.520 --> 38:39.960
Zero.

38:41.160 --> 38:42.040
Well,

38:42.560 --> 38:43.920
guess no news is good news.

38:52.000 --> 38:52.560
Freezing?

38:54.960 --> 38:56.040
I always thought

38:56.440 --> 38:58.680
"piercing cold" was just dramatic.

38:58.960 --> 38:59.920
But no, it's a literal feeling.

39:08.880 --> 39:09.320
Put this on.

39:33.640 --> 39:34.160
Come on.

40:05.920 --> 40:06.360
Let's roll!

40:11.520 --> 40:12.400
Go!

40:23.080 --> 40:23.720
Hanging out without me?

40:24.400 --> 40:25.560
Just... going for a spin...

40:25.640 --> 40:26.720
Gatekeeping the fun, huh?

40:27.720 --> 40:29.200
We didn't expect you back so soon...

40:29.280 --> 40:30.600
Yeah, whatever.

40:30.840 --> 40:31.640
Slide over!

40:35.240 --> 40:35.720
Alright,

40:35.760 --> 40:36.080
let's move!

40:36.080 --> 40:36.800
Yay!

40:36.920 --> 40:37.920
Go, go, go!

40:38.120 --> 40:38.640
Roll out!

40:38.800 --> 40:39.680
Let's hit it!

40:41.640 --> 40:43.600
Left, right, left...

40:43.680 --> 40:44.160
Squad, halt!

40:44.720 --> 40:45.520
Right, face!

40:45.840 --> 40:46.200
Face~

40:46.640 --> 40:46.960
Face!

40:47.640 --> 40:49.320
To the wild

40:49.840 --> 40:51.680
and free!

40:55.640 --> 40:56.200
Charge!

40:56.240 --> 40:57.440
Charge!

42:17.760 --> 42:19.560
Cheers!

42:23.400 --> 42:23.800
This is so good.

42:23.880 --> 42:24.360
Smooth!

42:25.000 --> 42:26.240
Honestly, the work is brutal,

42:26.520 --> 42:27.800
but the vibes are immaculate.

42:27.800 --> 42:28.640
I'm so moving here!

42:29.160 --> 42:30.480
You're just on a trial run.

42:30.760 --> 42:31.680
It's just the aesthetic.

42:31.800 --> 42:32.320
Try grinding here

42:32.320 --> 42:33.280
for a year.

42:33.360 --> 42:34.320
The magic wears off fast.

42:35.920 --> 42:36.920
If everything

42:36.920 --> 42:38.080
was a green light,

42:38.320 --> 42:39.000
what's your

42:39.000 --> 42:39.600
dream career?

42:40.800 --> 42:41.440
I...

42:42.440 --> 42:43.200
wanna be a singer.

42:44.160 --> 42:44.720
SINGER, huh?

42:45.200 --> 42:46.120
Don't kill my vibe!

42:46.200 --> 42:47.680
Don't listen to him.

42:47.960 --> 42:49.280
Your rap was

42:49.520 --> 42:50.600
literally fire!

42:50.920 --> 42:51.680
I'm a fan!

42:52.720 --> 42:53.280
I'd...

42:53.800 --> 42:55.000
be a painter.

42:55.680 --> 42:57.000
But honestly, that's a reach.

42:59.360 --> 42:59.840
Me?

43:00.520 --> 43:02.160
My ultimate gig is...

43:02.200 --> 43:02.680
Truck driver!

43:04.240 --> 43:05.080
Bro, you still remember?

43:05.640 --> 43:06.960
Respect!

43:07.360 --> 43:09.360
You've said it since first grade.

43:09.680 --> 43:11.200
I could recite it in my sleep!

43:12.080 --> 43:13.760
Wait, you're a boat kid.

43:13.760 --> 43:14.960
Why the obsession with trucks?

43:15.080 --> 43:16.800
Because boats are a trap.

43:16.840 --> 43:17.520
You look out,

43:17.560 --> 43:19.160
and it's just endless NPC water.

43:19.360 --> 43:21.320
But in a big rig,

43:21.520 --> 43:22.280
you're constantly unlocked.

43:22.280 --> 43:23.320
New places,

43:23.440 --> 43:24.240
new vibes.

43:25.360 --> 43:26.120
Hate to break it to you,

43:26.400 --> 43:27.520
but your folks

43:27.800 --> 43:29.120
are definitely grooming you

43:29.320 --> 43:30.520
for the fleet!

43:30.840 --> 43:32.760
That's just their safety net.

43:33.320 --> 43:34.160
Real talk,

43:34.560 --> 43:35.880
island folks want

43:35.880 --> 43:36.720
their kids on land.

43:36.800 --> 43:37.600
My dad's like

43:38.000 --> 43:38.960
a shark;

43:39.160 --> 43:40.280
he's built for the deep.

43:40.880 --> 43:42.000
But me? A stray dog.

43:42.000 --> 43:42.600
I gotta

43:42.600 --> 43:44.080
run wild on the land!
